# memento owner root — only the mechanism's own repeatedly-written files are ignored.
# Everything a ghost authors beside them (GROUND.md, MEMENTO.md, node spaces) is the
# owner's call: this file names files, never a directory and never a suffix.
.lock
branches.jsonl
*.ref.json
*/branches/*/meta.json
*/branches/*/commits.jsonl
*/branches/*/commit_notes.jsonl
*/branches/*/confluences.jsonl
*/branches/*/children.jsonl
